{"seq":3,"slug":"failover-rto-rpo","title":"RTO/RPO 目标与切换演练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/failover-splitbrain/failover-rto-rpo","wordCount":2586,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"rto-rpo-目标与切换演练\">RTO/RPO 目标与切换演练</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RTO（recovery time objective，恢复时间目标）与 RPO（recovery point objective，恢复点目标）是容灾领域最常被引用、也最常被含糊表述的两个数字。它们的真实含义非常具体：<strong>RPO 是在故障发生那一刻，允许丢失多少「已经对用户承诺成功」的数据；RTO 是从故障发生到服务恢复可接受水平所允许的时间</strong>。注意两者的起点相同而终点不同——RPO 度量的是过去的损失，RTO 度量的是未来的等待。</p>\n<p>它们被含糊表述的典型形式是「我们的 RPO 接近于零、RTO 在分钟级」。这句话在事故复盘时会被逐字追问：接近于零是多少秒？在什么故障场景下？用什么方式测出来的？「分钟级」是几分钟？包含人工审批时间吗？因此本篇的第一个任务是把这两个数字变成<strong>可计算、可演练、可验收</strong>的量，而不是文档里的承诺。</p>\n<p>需要先明确一个前提：RTO 与 RPO 都不是系统的固有属性，而是<strong>场景相关的</strong>。同一个系统在「单节点故障」与「区域级故障」下的 RTO 可能相差一个数量级，在「链路抖动」与「区域整体失联」下的 RPO 也不同。因此正确的表述形式是场景与目标的配对表，而不是两个孤立的数字。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  F[故障发生 T0] --&gt; D[检测耗时]&#10;  D --&gt; G[决策耗时]&#10;  G --&gt; I[隔离耗时]&#10;  I --&gt; C[追平耗时]&#10;  C --&gt; V[校验耗时]&#10;  V --&gt; S[服务恢复 T1]&#10;  F -.最后已确认事务位置.-&gt; R[RPO = T0 前丢失窗口]&#10;  S -.-&gt; T[RTO = T1 - T0]\">graph TD\n  F[故障发生 T0] --&gt; D[检测耗时]\n  D --&gt; G[决策耗时]\n  G --&gt; I[隔离耗时]\n  I --&gt; C[追平耗时]\n  C --&gt; V[校验耗时]\n  V --&gt; S[服务恢复 T1]\n  F -.最后已确认事务位置.-&gt; R[RPO = T0 前丢失窗口]\n  S -.-&gt; T[RTO = T1 - T0]</pre><h2 id=\"rpo-的构成与计算\">RPO 的构成与计算</h2><p>RPO 不是一个可以直接配置的参数，它是复制模式、复制延迟分布、以及切换时副本选择的共同结果。以异步复制为例，故障发生时刻主库上「已提交但尚未被任何异地副本应用」的事务数量决定了丢失量，而这个数量取决于那一刻的复制延迟：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RPO_{bytes} \\approx rate_{write} \\times L_{repl}(t_0) \\times p_{tail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{repl}(t_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是故障时刻的复制延迟，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{tail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用于保守估计的分位系数（因为故障可能落在延迟的高峰期）。这个式子说明了一件重要的事：<strong>RPO 随系统负载变化</strong>。同一个系统在低谷期的 RPO 可能是 0.2 秒，在峰值可能超过 5 秒。因此容灾目标必须按峰值负载下的延迟分布来定义，否则声明的 RPO 会在最需要它的时候失效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按复制模式分别推导\">按复制模式分别推导</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复制模式</th>\n<th>RPO 决定因素</th>\n<th>可达到的量级</th>\n<th>关键前提</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>故障时刻复制延迟 × 写入速率</td>\n<td>与延迟同量级，峰值可达秒级</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半同步</td>\n<td>未确认事务（通常 &lt; 1 个 RTT 的量）</td>\n<td>亚秒到百毫秒</td>\n<td>提升时选中已确认的那个副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全同步</td>\n<td>无丢失（全部副本已确认）</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>全部副本可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多主</td>\n<td>由冲突解决策略决定</td>\n<td>不适用传统 RPO 定义</td>\n<td>冲突策略可判定归属</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"多主形态下定义失效\">多主形态下定义失效</h3><p>多主形态下传统 RPO 的定义会失效，因为「丢失」不再是「某个事务没被复制」，而可能是「某个写入被冲突解决规则覆盖了」。此时正确的度量是<strong>冲突解决导致的写入丢失率</strong>，它的监控方式见<a href=\"../replication-consistency/cross-region-conflict-resolve\">跨区冲突检测与解决</a>。把这个量硬套成 RPO 会掩盖真实问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rto-的构成与可控项\">RTO 的构成与可控项</h2><p>RTO 分解为五个时间段，每段的可控性差别很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>典型量级</th>\n<th>可控性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检测</td>\n<td>判定故障成立</td>\n<td>秒级到分钟级</td>\n<td>高（调整阈值与证据要求）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策</td>\n<td>决定提升、选定候选</td>\n<td>秒级（自动）到分钟级（人工）</td>\n<td>高（自动化程度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离</td>\n<td>确认旧主无法写入</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>中（取决于隔离机制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追平</td>\n<td>候选副本追到目标位置</td>\n<td>由落后量决定，可能很长</td>\n<td>低到中（取决于延迟分布）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验</td>\n<td>一致性检查、冒烟测试</td>\n<td>秒级到分钟级</td>\n<td>中（检查项设计）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"追平常成为主要构成\">追平常成为主要构成</h3><p>两个容易被低估的部分值得单独指出。<strong>追平阶段</strong>在多活系统里经常成为 RTO 的主要构成：如果候选副本落后数分钟（例如它一直是个冷备、复制优先级低），那么追平时间就已经超过了许多团队声明的 RTO 目标。这解释了为什么「有一个异地副本」不等于「有一个可用备援」——备援的可用性取决于它平时的追赶状态，而这属于<a href=\"../replication-ops/replication-topology-lag-monitor\">拓扑、延迟与断链监控</a>要持续观测的内容。</p>\n<h3 id=\"校验被压缩的隐蔽代价\">校验被压缩的隐蔽代价</h3><p><strong>校验阶段</strong>则是最常被压缩、代价却最隐蔽的一段。跳过校验可以缩短 RTO，但如果候选副本的数据本身有问题（磁盘静默损坏、复制错位），跳过校验意味着把故障切换变成了数据事故的放大器。因此校验项应当被设计成「能在秒级完成、且能捕捉最常见故障模式」的集合，而不是一个完整的数据一致性校验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"演练设计-目标是暴露缺陷\">演练设计：目标是暴露缺陷</h2><p>切换演练最常见的失败模式是把它做成了<strong>演示</strong>——在受控环境下走一遍流程，证明「能切换」，然后就结束了。这种演练几乎不产生任何信息，因为它刻意避开了真实故障中的困难：它不会制造不对称分区，不会让候选副本落后，不会让监控产生误导信号，也不会让参与者在信息不全的情况下做决策。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三条设计原则\">三条设计原则</h3><p>有效的演练设计遵循三个原则。其一是<strong>注入真实故障而非模拟</strong>：真正切断区域间的网络出口，而不是只杀掉一个进程；真正让候选副本落后，而不是假设它是新的。其二是<strong>不给参与者额外信息</strong>：如果演练时运维能直接看到「这是演练」的标记，那么他就是在做题而不是在救火。其三是<strong>度量而非观察</strong>：记录检测时间、决策时间、隔离确认时间、追平时间、校验时间的实际值，与目标对比，差值就是改进项。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>演练类型</th>\n<th>注入内容</th>\n<th>主要暴露的问题</th>\n<th>频率建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只读切换</td>\n<td>停止主库写入，切只读</td>\n<td>读路由、缓存、连接池假设</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主库切换</td>\n<td>隔离主库并提升候选</td>\n<td>隔离有效性、追平时间、校验</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域隔离</td>\n<td>切断整个区域出入口</td>\n<td>检测准确性、非对称分区</td>\n<td>半年度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据校验</td>\n<td>静默损坏副本后切换</td>\n<td>校验项是否有效</td>\n<td>半年度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全流程带人工</td>\n<td>包含审批与通知链路</td>\n<td>决策时间、沟通链路</td>\n<td>年度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四类演练尤其值得做，因为它检验的是「校验阶段是否真的有价值」：如果注入一个数据损坏的副本后，切换流程仍然顺利通过并对外提供服务，那么你的校验项形同虚设。这类演练的预期结果是<strong>切换被中止</strong>，中止才是通过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标设定与成本的匹配\">目标设定与成本的匹配</h2><p>RTO 与 RPO 每收紧一档，成本通常不是线性增加。把 RPO 从秒级收紧到零需要从异步升级到全同步，代价是跨区 RTT 进入写入路径，写入可用性下降；把 RTO 从十分钟收紧到一分钟需要候选副本平时保持接近实时同步，代价是常驻的复制带宽与更频繁的隔离验证。因此在设定目标前必须先确认业务含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>丢失一小时的数据是「需要重新录入」还是「不可接受的合规事件」？</li>\n<li>停服十分钟是「用户抱怨」还是「触发合同违约条款」？</li>\n<li>停机期间是否有降级路径（只读、排队、异步受理）可以缩短「可接受水平」的判定？</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"先问业务含义-再定数字\">先问业务含义，再定数字</h3><p>回答完这三个问题，目标通常会自然落在某个档位上，而这个档位对应的成本是可接受的。反过来先定「我们要 5 个 9」再找实现方式，往往会得到一个成本远超收益的方案，或者一个在第一次真实故障中就失效的方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"场景与目标的配对配置\">场景与目标的配对配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;disaster_recovery&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;scenarios&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;single_node_failure&quot;,&#10;        &quot;rto_minutes&quot;: 1,&#10;        &quot;rpo_seconds&quot;: 0,&#10;        &quot;mechanism&quot;: &quot;intra_region_consensus&quot;,&#10;        &quot;verified_by&quot;: &quot;monthly_readonly_drill&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;region_failure&quot;,&#10;        &quot;rto_minutes&quot;: 15,&#10;        &quot;rpo_seconds&quot;: 2,&#10;        &quot;mechanism&quot;: &quot;cross_region_promotion&quot;,&#10;        &quot;requires&quot;: [&quot;fencing_verified&quot;, &quot;candidate_lag_under_5s&quot;],&#10;        &quot;verified_by&quot;: &quot;quarterly_primary_drill&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;asymmetric_partition&quot;,&#10;        &quot;rto_minutes&quot;: 30,&#10;        &quot;rpo_seconds&quot;: 0,&#10;        &quot;mechanism&quot;: &quot;refuse_promotion_until_fenced&quot;,&#10;        &quot;verified_by&quot;: &quot;semiannual_region_isolation_drill&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;drill_evidence_retention_days&quot;: 730&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"disaster_recovery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"scenarios\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"single_node_failure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rto_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rpo_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"mechanism\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intra_region_consensus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"verified_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"monthly_readonly_drill\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"region_failure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rto_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rpo_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"mechanism\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cross_region_promotion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"requires\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fencing_verified\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"candidate_lag_under_5s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"verified_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quarterly_primary_drill\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"asymmetric_partition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rto_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rpo_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"mechanism\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refuse_promotion_until_fenced\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"verified_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"semiannual_region_isolation_drill\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"drill_evidence_retention_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">730</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份配置的关键设计是把<strong>场景与目标配对</strong>、把<strong>机制与前提条件显式声明</strong>（<code>requires</code> 字段）、把<strong>验证方式绑定到具体演练</strong>（<code>verified_by</code>）。第三个场景的目标值尤其值得注意：<code>rpo_seconds</code> 为 0 而 RTO 长达 30 分钟，这是因为在非对称分区下正确的行为是<strong>拒绝提升并等待隔离确认</strong>，宁可延长停写也不制造双主——这个取舍必须被写进目标，否则演练时会被当作「系统没切换成功，失败了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RTO 度量故障后到恢复的时间，RPO 度量故障时刻已承诺数据的允许丢失量；两者都场景相关，正确表述形式是场景与目标配对的表格。</li>\n<li>RPO 由复制模式、故障时刻的复制延迟分布、切换时副本选择共同决定；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RPO \\approx rate \\times L_{repl}(t_0) \\times p_{tail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，随负载变化，必须按峰值延迟定义。</li>\n<li>多主形态下传统 RPO 定义失效，应改用冲突解决导致的写入丢失率来度量。</li>\n<li>RTO 分为检测、决策、隔离、追平、校验五段；追平常成为主要构成（候选落后者不可用），校验被压缩则会把切换变成数据事故放大器。</li>\n<li>演练的目标是暴露缺陷而非演示能力：注入真实故障、不提供演练标记、度量各阶段实际耗时；数据损坏类演练的通过标准是切换被中止。</li>\n<li>目标设定必须与业务含义和成本匹配；非对称分区场景下「拒绝提升并延长停写」是正确行为，应在目标中以高 RTO、零 RPO 显式表达，见<a href=\"split-brain-fencing\">脑裂防护与隔离</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RTO/RPO 目标与切换演练","id":"rto-rpo-目标与切换演练"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RPO 的构成与计算","id":"rpo-的构成与计算"},{"level":3,"text":"按复制模式分别推导","id":"按复制模式分别推导"},{"level":3,"text":"多主形态下定义失效","id":"多主形态下定义失效"},{"level":2,"text":"RTO 的构成与可控项","id":"rto-的构成与可控项"},{"level":3,"text":"追平常成为主要构成","id":"追平常成为主要构成"},{"level":3,"text":"校验被压缩的隐蔽代价","id":"校验被压缩的隐蔽代价"},{"level":2,"text":"演练设计：目标是暴露缺陷","id":"演练设计-目标是暴露缺陷"},{"level":3,"text":"三条设计原则","id":"三条设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"目标设定与成本的匹配","id":"目标设定与成本的匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"先问业务含义，再定数字","id":"先问业务含义-再定数字"},{"level":3,"text":"场景与目标的配对配置","id":"场景与目标的配对配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"脑裂防护与隔离（fencing）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/failover-splitbrain/split-brain-fencing"},"next":{"title":"拓扑、延迟与断链监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/replication-ops/replication-topology-lag-monitor"}}